WEBVTT

00:02:56.396 --> 00:03:00.316
The number one reason
for forgetting what someone said,

00:03:00.356 --> 00:03:02.916
the name of a person you just met,

00:03:02.916 --> 00:03:04.676
where you parked your car

00:03:04.716 --> 00:03:07.876
and whether you already drove
over a really big bridge

00:03:07.916 --> 00:03:09.916
is lack of attention.

00:03:10.796 --> 00:03:12.356
Number two,

00:03:12.396 --> 00:03:14.756
"Oh, what is his name?"

00:03:15.636 --> 00:03:17.596
One day I couldn't come up with the name

00:03:17.636 --> 00:03:22.396
of the actor who played Tony Soprano
in the HBO series "The Sopranos."

00:03:22.396 --> 00:03:25.396
I knew his name was stored
somewhere in my brain,

00:03:25.436 --> 00:03:28.036
and I could tell you
all kinds of things about him,

00:03:28.076 --> 00:03:30.796
but I could not produce his name.